{"id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1.md","title":"Exponentiation Is Sigma-1 Without an Exponent Symbol","display":"thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1 — Exponentiation Is Sigma-1 Without an Exponent Symbol","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1"],"display":"thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1 — Exponentiation Is Sigma-1 Without an Exponent Symbol","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–48，Theorem E（PDF 62–65）","source_status":"原书 Theorem E 的显式重构与边界修正","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1 — Exponentiation Is Sigma-1 Without an Exponent Symbol"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–48，Theorem E（PDF 62–65）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书 Theorem E 的显式重构与边界修正"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e6768aadf6214a6\" href=\"?note=9e6768aadf6214a6\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code\">92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c7c8d1473c7d455\" href=\"?note=0c7c8d1473c7d455\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma\">92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；外部幂取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^0=1\">\\(x^0=1\\)</span>（含 x=0）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E\">\\(K_E\\)</span> 为上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 有界成员关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E\\)</span> 为下文的三元算术关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}exponent\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists w\\;[K_E(y,z,w)\\land\\forall a\\leq w\\;\\forall b\\leq w\\;(K_E(a,b,w)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}[(a=0\\land b=1)\\lor\\exists c\\leq w\\;\\exists d\\leq w\\;\n(K_E(c,d,w)\\land a=c+1\\land b=d\\cdot x)])],\\\\\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x^y=z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,3}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}exponent\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists w\\;[K_E(y,z,w)\\land\\forall a\\leq w\\;\\forall b\\leq w\\;(K_E(a,b,w)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}[(a=0\\land b=1)\\lor\\exists c\\leq w\\;\\exists d\\leq w\\;\n(K_E(c,d,w)\\land a=c+1\\land b=d\\cdot x)])],\\\\\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x^y=z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,3}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向用有限图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{(0,1),(1,x),\\ldots,(y,x^y)\\}\">\\(\\{(0,1),(1,x),\\ldots,(y,x^y)\\}\\)</span> 的 K 编码；其中所有前身见证 c,d 均≤w。反向对满足 K 的第一分量 a 作元语言归纳：a=0 只能有 b=1；a&gt;0 则由 c=a−1 的成员和归纳假设得 b=<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^a\">\\(x^a\\)</span>，最后用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,z)\">\\((y,z)\\)</span> 成员得结论。矩阵只有 bounded 量词，故是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 表达。</p>\n<p>本地重构修正原书 p.47 的两处显示问题：首项应为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(y,z,w)\">\\(K(y,z,w)\\)</span>，不能照抄 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(x,y,w)\">\\(K(x,y,w)\\)</span>；前身 d 的界改为 w，不能总写 d≤b。当 x=0、y=1、z=0 时所需 d=1、b=0，原界会错误拒绝 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^1=0\">\\(0^1=0\\)</span>。本版本也覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"9e6768aadf6214a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"0c7c8d1473c7d455","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"K_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}exponent\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E(x,y,z)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists w\\;[K_E(y,z,w)\\land\\forall a\\leq w\\;\\forall b\\leq w\\;(K_E(a,b,w)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}[(a=0\\land b=1)\\lor\\exists c\\leq w\\;\\exists d\\leq w\\;\n(K_E(c,d,w)\\land a=c+1\\land b=d\\cdot x)])],\\\\\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E(x,y,z)&\\leftrightarrow x^y=z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ExpRel}_E\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,3}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{(0,1),(1,x),\\ldots,(y,x^y)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x^a","display":false},{"tex":"(y,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"K(y,z,w)","display":false},{"tex":"K(x,y,w)","display":false},{"tex":"0^1=0","display":false},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false}],"bytes":1834,"backlinks":[{"id":"e095d63f890051fd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2897638221489da5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 arithmetic formula 在 L_E 中排除指数函数名，仍有原始 ≤。本文使用仅等式的 G 语言；原书的无指数公式集是 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] 中 Fml_A。指数关系可算术表达依赖 [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]，不由“去掉一个符号”的定义推出。"},{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"52be70588beee387","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f1638d16173e7b51","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]"}],"outgoing":["9e6768aadf6214a6","0c7c8d1473c7d455"]}